   💥 MalfunctionError: the fetch TIMED OUT (curl 28) — https://example.com/x.tgz
      ⇒ the transfer stalled: it sat below 1KB/s for 60s, or ran past
        600s in total. that is a wire fault, NOT an absent file
      ⇒ a grove reaches the wire through its nat, so a stalled flow
        there is the ordinary failure of that path — retry first
